        <mxCell id="her_api" value="&lt;b&gt;Contrato HTTP por la LAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;mangascan_client.py → API de MangaScan&lt;br&gt;GET /api/jobs · ¿responde?, cola&lt;br&gt;POST /api/upload · sube el PDF&lt;br&gt;GET /api/stream/{id} · progreso (SSE)&lt;br&gt;GET /api/download/{id} · PDF traducido&lt;br&gt;POST /api/cancel/{id} + DELETE /api/jobs/{id} · ⏹️ Cancelar&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="carril_her">
